I tend to build up save games on the machine I am working from. These
are from games I saved but did not come back to right away. I would
like to devise a system for these so that I know where I stand in the
game. Perhaps, items such as whether I have descended to the bottom of
mine town, and whether I have stashes stored on certain levels. Does
anyone else deal with this? For a short time I was engraving in the
floor beneath where I saved a short descriptive note. This has the
caveat that I must know I am "abandoning" the game. Sometimes I save
expecting to return but just do not get back to the game. I feel that
I could make use of these saved games, and I am sure that some of them
are currently at a higher score than my current number one on this
